==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|krьstъ|lang=sh}}, from {{etyl|goh|sh}} {{term|Krist||Christ|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|la|sh}} {{term|Christus|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|sh}} {{term|Χριστός|tr=Khristós|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kr̂st/|lang=sh}}

===Noun===
{{sh-noun|g=m|head=кр̏ст|c|krst|kȑst}}

# [[cross]]

