====Usage notes====
This word, in religious context, is used mainly by Orthodox Christians, and consequently generally more common among Serbs than Croats. Catholics (and Croats generally) tend to prefer the term {{term|sc=Cyrl|криж|кри̑ж|lang=sh}}.

